<h3 class="subsection-title">Key Database Design Principles:</h3>
<p class="doc-p">1. <strong>Multi-Modal Payment Architecture (`sales`)</strong>:</p>
<li class="doc-li">`payment_method` accommodates `Cash`, `GCash`, `Card`, and <strong>`Split`</strong>.</li>
<li class="doc-li">Dedicated `cash_amount` and `gcash_amount` columns capture the exact dual-tender breakdown for split payments, ensuring accounting audits reconcile cash drawer balance and GCash wallet deposits.</li>
<p class="doc-p">2. <strong>Immutable Inventory Ledger (`inventory_transactions`)</strong>:</p>
<li class="doc-li">Protected against direct `UPDATE` and `DELETE` via MySQL database triggers (`trg_block_inventory_transactions_update`, `trg_block_inventory_transactions_delete`).</li>
<li class="doc-li">Protected against table truncation through foreign-key child table `inventory_transactions_lock`.</li>
<li class="doc-li">Guaranteed signed movement validation via SQL `CHECK` constraint: sales/losses require `quantity_change &lt; 0`, receipts/additions require `quantity_change &gt; 0`.</li>
<p class="doc-p">3. <strong>Dual-Layer Compatibility Matrix</strong>:</p>
<li class="doc-li"><strong>Exact-Fit Compatibility</strong>: Maps direct parts to exact motorcycle unit models (`product_compatibilities` &amp; `motorcycle_models`).</li>
<li class="doc-li"><strong>Platform-Level Compatibility</strong>: Groups families of models sharing identical engine/chassis platforms (e.g. <em>Yamaha Aerox Platform</em>, <em>Honda Click Platform</em>) via `compatibility_groups` and `product_compatibility_groups`.</li>
<p class="doc-p">4. <strong>Serialized Asset Control</strong>:</p>
<li class="doc-li">Distinct individual units (e.g., ECUs, Batteries, Expensive Electronics) are tracked through `product_serials` and bound to sales invoices via `sale_item_serials` to protect against duplicate allocation or fraudulent warranty claims.</li>
<p class="doc-p">5. <strong>Security &amp; Cryptographic Isolation</strong>:</p>
<li class="doc-li">`users.password` uses bcrypt (10 salt rounds) with live strength enforcement.</li>
<li class="doc-li">`users.token_version` is incremented on password changes to immediately revoke all existing JWTs across active browser sessions.</li>
<li class="doc-li">`password_otps` stores SHA-256 code hashes with a 10-minute expiry and a 5-attempt brute-force threshold.</li>

<hr class="doc-divider">

<h2 class="section-title">2. Data Flow Diagrams (DFD)</h2>

<h3 class="subsection-title">DFD Level 0: System Context Diagram</h3>

<p class="doc-p">The Context Diagram outlines the high-level boundary of the <strong>JLIN Motorparts Inventory &amp; POS System</strong> and interactions with all external entities.</p>

