<h3 class="subsection-title">DFD Level 1: Process Decomposition Diagram</h3>

<p class="doc-p">The Level 1 diagram breaks the system into its core operational processes, detailing interactions between external entities, business logic, persistent data stores, and analytical outputs across 4 structured layers.</p>

