 Database Engine Triggers &amp; Audit Guards<br>• trg_sync_products_insert / update<br>• trg_block_inventory_transactions_update<br>• trg_block_inventory_transactions_delete<br>• inventory_transactions_lock Immutability Anchor</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default ext flowchart-label" id="flowchart-ResendAPI-93" data-node="true" data-id="ResendAPI" transform="translate(716.08984375, 1341.9734191894531)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-187.1328125" y="-45.890625" width="374.265625" height="91.78125"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-179.6328125, -38.390625)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="359.265625" height="76.78125"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">📧 Resend Cloud Email API (HTTPS REST Port 443)<br>• Bypasses Cloud Platform SMTP Egress Blocks<br>• Dispatches 6-Digit Verification Codes &amp; OTPs</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t2 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-RenderService-88" data-node="true" data-id="RenderService" transform="translate(861.1171875, 610.21875)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-149.828125" y="-33.09375" width="299.65625" height="66.1875"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-142.328125, -25.59375)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="284.65625" height="51.1875"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">⚙️ Render Web Service<br>(https://jlin-motorparts.onrender.com)</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t2 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-ExpressApp-89" data-node="true" data-id="ExpressApp" transform="translate(861.1171875, 803.1875)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-194.796875" y="-84.28125" width="389.59375" height="168.5625"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-187.296875, -76.78125)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="374.59375" height="153.5625"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">⚡ Node.js 24 + Express 5 REST API<br>• Helmet Security Headers (CSP &amp; HSTS)<br>• Strict CORS Origin &amp; Rate Limit Protection<br>• JWT Bearer Token Verification &amp; Token Revocation<br>• Express-Validator &amp; Zod Payload Schemas<br>• Automated Schema Migration (ensureSchema.js)</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t2 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-AuthModule-90" data-node="true" data-id="AuthModule" transform="translate(716.08984375, 1046.15625)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-118.46875" y="-58.6875" width="236.9375" height="117.375"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-110.96875, -51.1875)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="221.9375" height="102.375"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">🔐 Auth &amp; Recovery Controller<br>• Bcrypt 10-Round Hasher<br>• 6-Digit Crypto OTPs<br>• JWT Token Dispatcher</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t2 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-InventoryModule-91" data-node="true" data-id="InventoryModule" transform="translate(1006.14453125, 1046.15625)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-121.5859375" y="-58.6875" width="243.171875" height="117.375"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-114.0859375, -51.1875)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="228.171875" height="102.375"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">📦 Inventory &amp; Fitment Service<br>• Atomic Transaction Engine<br>• Canonical Product Sync<br>• Reorder Level Evaluator</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t2 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-POSModule-92" data-node="true" data-id="POSModule" transform="translate(1297.05078125, 1046.15625)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-119.3203125" y="-58.6875" width="238.640625" height="117.375"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-111.8203125, -51.1875)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="223.640625" height="102.375"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">🛒 POS Checkout Engine<br>• Split Payment (Cash + GCash)<br>• Serial Number Guard<br>• Void &amp; Re-open Cart Engine</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t1 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-Browser-85" data-node="true" data-id="Browser" transform="translate(861.1171875, 45.296875)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-123.8203125" y="-20.296875" width="247.640625" height="40.59375"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-116.3203125, -12.796875)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="232.640625" height="25.59375"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">🖥️ Staff / Admin Browser Client</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t1 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-VercelCDN-86" data-node="true" data-id="VercelCDN" transform="translate(861.1171875, 174.28125)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-138.75" y="-33.09375" width="277.5" height="66.1875"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-131.25, -25.59375)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="262.5" height="51.1875"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">🌐 Vercel Global Edge Network<br>(https://jlin-motorparts.vercel.app)</span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class="node default t1 flowchart-label" id="flowchart-ReactApp-87" data-node="true" data-id="ReactApp" transform="translate(861.1171875, 367.25)"><rect class="basic label-container" style="" rx="0" ry="0" x="-187.203125" y="-84.28125" width="374.40625" height="168.5625"></rect><g class="label" style="" transform="translate(-179.703125, -76.78125)"><rect></rect><foreignObject width="359.40625" height="153.5625"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="nodeLabel">⚛️ React 19 SPA (Vite Bundler)<br>• React Router 7 Declarative Navigation<br>• Modern Glassmorphic UI &amp; Dark/Light Theme<br>• Native 58mm/80mm Thermal Receipt Generator<br>• Real-time POS Cart with Split Payment Modal<br>• Consolidated Account &amp; Security Hub (/profile)</span></div></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g></svg></pre></div>

<hr class="doc-divider">

<h2 class="section-title">4. Architectural Quality Attributes &amp; Defense Readiness</h2>

<div class="table-container"><table class="doc-table">
<thead><tr><th>Quality Attribute</th><th>Architectural Implementation</th><th>Verification Method</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td><strong>Multi-Tender Flexibility</strong></td><td>Split Payment engine allows splitting bills across Cash and GCash with live balance tracking, change calculation, and database tracking of `cash_amount` and `gcash_amount`.</td><td>Verified on POS checkout with automated invariant testing: `cash + gcash &gt;= total`.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Data Integrity</strong></td><td>Database-level triggers prevent ledger modification; `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE` row locking prevents concurrent double-spend of serial numbers.</td><td>Trigger rejection unit tests &amp; concurrent checkout test scenarios.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Authentication &amp; Access</strong></td><td>JWT authentication with dual-role RBAC (`admin` vs. `staff`). Immediate multi-device invalidation through `users.token_version`. Live password checklist enforces strong credentials.</td><td>Automated OTP test suite &amp; password strength validation.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Email Resilience</strong></td><td>Outbound OTP emails use the Resend HTTPS REST API over port 443, eliminating SMTP timeout blocks (`ETIMEDOUT`) enforced by cloud hosting firewalls.</td><td>Live delivery verification to Gmail in 1.2s.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Fault Tolerance &amp; Zero Downtime</strong></td><td>Auto-migration scripts ([`backend/utils/ensureSchema.js`](file:///c:/Inventory/backend/utils/ensureSchema.js) &amp; schema patches) add missing tables and columns on server boot without manual SQL execution.</td><td>Automated deployment boot verification.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Navigation &amp; Ergonomics</strong></td><td>Strict `end` route matching on sidebar navigation prevents multi-link active states (e.g. Sales Reports vs Discrepancy Audit). Fitment Search and Compatibility Rules consolidated into Account &amp; Security (`/profile`).</td><td>UI visual audit on Desktop &amp; Mobile viewports.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Cart Preservation &amp; Void Re-open</strong></td><td>POS payment modal supports closing via `Esc` key, background backdrop click, or "← Back to Cart" button without losing cart items. Completed sales can be immediately reversed via "↩ Void &amp; Return to Cart" on the receipt modal, restoring stock and repopulating cart.</td><td>Interactive modal state lifecycle verification &amp; database stock recovery test.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>


